189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 56 0 R
/E (Week 0 of the Carisurg MedTech Pathways program has been an engaging and insightful introduction to clinical and technical concepts. The triage pseudocode task was particularly challenging for me, but it strengthened my problem-solving skills and highlighted areas where I can continue to improve. The support from peers and mentors also made the experience especially positive and motivating.)
